{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And the mishkan you shall make.</b> He calls the <b>curtains</b> by the name mishkan, for within them were the throne, table, and menorah for the dwelling of the Shekhinah, and they were made with cherubim, like the matter of שְׂרָפִים עֹמְדִים מִמַּעַל לוֹ (Isaiah 6:2), and like the matter of וְכָל צְבָא הַשָּׁמַיִם עֹמְדִים עָלָיו מִימִינוֹ וּמִשְּׂמֹאלוֹ (I Kings 22:19), which are seen by the prophets in visions of prophecy."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:27:20.960524212Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}